    <briefdescription>
<para>A used slice of an alloca. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This structure represents a slice of an alloca used by some instruction. It stores both the begin and end offsets of this use, a pointer to the use itself, and a flag indicating whether we can classify the use as splittable or not when forming partitions of the alloca. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
